        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Georgica Handleset from the Classico Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's Georgica Classico Collection Mortise Entryset has an attention unrivaled by other handlesets. Every inch of it has been thoughtfully designed to enhance its elegance. The Georgica Handleset from the Classico Collection is available with your choice of interior trim--which are all works of art themselves. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, and Venetian Nickel finishes--all of which are designed to highlight the beautiful details of both backplate and trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso See <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=classico+collection\"><b>Omnia's Complete Classico Collection</b></a> for matching knobs, levers, and deadbolts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classico Collection Georgica Entry Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Georgica Classico Collection Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 22-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 1-1/4\" wide with a 1-1/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: Interior knob/lever, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates.</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Standard Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside,  thumbpiece outside except when outside is locked by rocker switch on mortise box; then opens by key outside, by lever or knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside,  thumbpiece outside except when outside is locked by rocker switch on mortise box; then opens by key outside, by lever or knob inside.  Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<!-- <li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece. Deadbolt activated only by key on both the inside and the outside.</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Georgica Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Georgica Classico Collection Mortise Entryset",
